@startuml
title CON-SD-D08 Payment, Fiscal Issuance, and ExitAuthorization Under Continuity
skinparam shadowing false

participant "Continuity channel / terminal" as Channel
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Payment Orchestrator" as Pay
participant "Site POS Server" as POS
participant "Gate / Exit" as Gate
participant "Audit / Reconciliation" as Audit

Channel -> Central : request allowed continuity payment workflow
Central -> Central : validate activation scope + payable basis
Central -> Pay : payment provider workflow
Pay --> Central : verified provider outcome
Central -> Central : record payment finality
Central -> POS : request Sales Invoice issuance
alt fiscal issued
  POS --> Central : fiscal identity/status
  Central -> Central : record fiscal reference
  Central -> Central : issue ExitAuthorization if eligible
  Central -> Gate : authorization consumed
else fiscal pending / failed / timeout
  POS --> Central : exception status
  Central -> Central : block normal ExitAuthorization
end
Central -> Audit : continuity tags and outcomes

note bottom
POS Server issues fiscal documents.
Central PMS owns finality, fiscal reference recording, and ExitAuthorization.
end note
@enduml
